 stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-list-checks h-4 w-4 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 5h8"></path><path d="M13 12h8"></path><path d="M13 19h8"></path><path d="m3 17 2 2 4-4"></path><path d="m3 7 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight">IPD &amp; beds</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Admission, occupancy, nursing, discharge summary.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-list-checks h-4 w-4 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 5h8"></path><path d="M13 12h8"></path><path d="M13 19h8"></path><path d="m3 17 2 2 4-4"></path><path d="m3 7 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight">Pharmacy</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Prescription-linked sale, batch, expiry, PO.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-list-checks h-4 w-4 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 5h8"></path><path d="M13 12h8"></path><path d="M13 19h8"></path><path d="m3 17 2 2 4-4"></path><path d="m3 7 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight">Billing &amp; TPA</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Packages, deposits, insurance, GST-ready invoices.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-list-checks h-4 w-4 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 5h8"></path><path d="M13 12h8"></path><path d="M13 19h8"></path><path d="m3 17 2 2 4-4"></path><path d="m3 7 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight">Investigations</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Orders that billing and the lab can both see.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-list-checks h-4 w-4 text-brand-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 5h8"></path><path d="M13 12h8"></path><path d="M13 19h8"></path><path d="m3 17 2 2 4-4"></path><path d="m3 7 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight">Audit trail</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Who saw, who changed, who billed — required, not optional.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative isolate py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-28"><div class="container-default"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><div class="mb-4 flex justify-center"><span class="chip-brand inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-foreground"></span>People</span></div><h2 class="text-balance text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] lg:leading-[1.08]">What each role actually does in the system.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-pretty text-base text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg">Software fails when only the owner saw the demo. This is the day-one job for the people who will live in it.</p></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="flex gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-foreground text-brand-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="